## 7. Find the Largest of Two Numbers Using Instance Variables

### 💡 Concept

Compare two values using `if-else` to identify the larger number.

### 💻 Code

```java
class LargestNumber {
    int a;
    int b;

    void findLargest() {
        if (a > b) {
            System.out.println("Largest = " + a);
        } else {
            System.out.println("Largest = " + b);
        }
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        LargestNumber s = new LargestNumber();
        s.a = 25;
        s.b = 40;
        s.findLargest();
    }
}
```

### 📤 Output

```text
Largest = 40
```

### 🧠 Memory Trick

Compare first, then print the appropriate value.

**Interview improvement:** This code handles equal values correctly too, because when `a == b`, it prints `b`, which is still the largest value.

