## 10. Calculate the Sum of Two Numbers Using an Instance Method

### 💡 Concept

Addition combines two numbers to produce their sum.

### 💻 Code

```java
class SumCalculator {
    int a;
    int b;

    void calculateSum() {
        int sum = a + b;
        System.out.println("Sum = " + sum);
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        SumCalculator s = new SumCalculator();
        s.a = 25;
        s.b = 15;
        s.calculateSum();
    }
}
```

### 📤 Output

```text
Sum = 40
```

### 🧠 Memory Trick

`sum = a + b;` adds the two values and stores the result in a local variable.

